      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ありがとう。きみには感謝を禁じ得ないよ。\nミトラス修道会の連中にこれ以上研究を\n邪魔されるなど、我慢できない。\n早晩帝都を発つよ。縁があったらまた会おう。",
        "official_en": "You found the tablet! Thank you. I'm eternally\ngrateful! But if the Order of Mithras would go this\nfar, then Dagsion might not be safe for me anymore.\nI need to leave, but I hope we meet again!",
        "real_en": null
